<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $1.00/1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $1.00/1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 higher. Trade moderately active. Top $62.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     61.00-62.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     61.00-61.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     59.00-60.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     55.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows:    300-450 lbs  steady to 0.50 higher; 450-700 lbs  steady</p>
<p>to 1.00 lower. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs     47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs     49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
